# STING tuning tables (GDD 13, T1-22). Read by the PoC (poc/sim/tunefile.js) and the C# core (Tune.cs).
# Edit values here; both read this file at start. A world records the hash of the file it was made with and will not
# load under different tuning, and peers must share it. Units: metres, seconds, ticks (60 per second), game minutes
# and days where the key says so. Lists in [brackets]; strings in "quotes".
